</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Engrave Your name on me,</l><l>(God as my identity),</l><l>And Your holy city named</l><l>The New Jerusalem.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Dear Lord, I am Your claim,</l><l>I will treasure our new name;</l><l>I will call Your name again,</l><l>The wedding can begin!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
